     <div class=\"info-field\"><label>STATION NO: 4<\/label><\/div><div class=\"info-field\"><\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"info-field\"><label>TASK: CONDUCTING 2ND STAGE OF LABOUR<\/label><\/div><div class=\"info-field\"><\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"info-field\"><label>Examiner's Name:<\/label><div class=\"line\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"info-field\"><label>Date:<\/label><div class=\"line\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"info-field\"><label>School code:<\/label><div class=\"line\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"info-field\"><label>Candidate's No:<\/label><div class=\"line\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n        <div class=\"table-scroll-wrapper\">\r\n            <table class=\"checklist-table\">\r\n                <thead><tr><th class=\"col-num\"><\/th><th class=\"col-key-areas\">Key areas to assess<\/th><th class=\"col-score\">Score<\/th><th class=\"col-status\">Done<\/th><th class=\"col-status\">Partially done<\/th><th class=\"col-status\">Not done<\/th><\/tr><\/thead>\r\n                <tbody>\r\n                    <tr><td class=\"col-num\">1<\/td><td class=\"col-key-areas\">Ensures privacy and explains to the mother that she is ready to push<\/td><td class=\"col-score\">1<\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td class=\"col-num\">2<\/td><td class=\"col-key-areas\">Ensures that her bladder is empty<\/td><td class=\"col-score\">1<\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td class=\"col-num\">3<\/td><td class=\"col-key-areas\">Brings trolley to the bed-side<\/td><td class=\"col-score\">-<\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td class=\"col-num\">4<\/td><td class=\"col-key-areas\">Positions mother in dorsal position and confirms 2nd stage of labour<\/td><td class=\"col-score\">\u00bd<\/td><td><\/td><td>x<\/td><td><\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td class=\"col-num\">5<\/td>\r\n                        <td class=\"col-key-areas\">Follows the following steps to deliver the mother;<ul class=\"sub-items\"><li>\u2022 Washes hands and puts on sterile gloves<\/li><li>\u2022 Swabs vulva and drapes the mother<\/li><li>\u2022 Encourages the mother to push with each contraction, maintains flexion of the head, at crowning perform episiotomy if necessary<\/li><li>\u2022 Delivers the head by extension and cleans airway<\/li><li>\u2022 Feels for the cord around the neck, if loose slips it over the head, if tight clamps and cuts<\/li><li>\u2022 Delivers the anterior shoulder, posterior shoulder and body by lateral flexion<\/li><li>\u2022 Notes the time, scores the baby and congratulates the mother<\/li><li>\u2022 Clamps and cuts the cord<\/li><li>\u2022 Wraps the baby on the mother's breast<\/li><\/ul><\/td>\r\n                        <td class=\"col-score\"><ul class=\"sub-items\" style=\"text-align: center; padding:0;\"><li>1<\/li><li>1<\/li><li>1<\/li><li>1<\/li><li>1<\/li><li>1<\/li><li>\u00bd<\/li><li>\u00bd<\/li><li>\u00bd<\/li><\/ul><\/td>\r\n                        <td><\/td><td><ul class=\"sub-items\" style=\"text-align: center; padding:0;\"><li><\/li><li><\/li><li><\/li><li><\/li><li><\/li><li><\/li><li>x<\/li><li>\u2713<\/li><li>x<\/li><\/ul><\/td><td><\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/tbody>\r\n                <tfoot><tr><td colspan=\"2\">TOTAL<\/td><td class=\"col-score\">10<\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><\/tr><\/tfoot>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <section class=\"comments-section\"><label>Examiner's Comments<\/label><div class=\"line\"><\/div><\/section>\r\n        <footer class=\"footer-logo\">@unmeb<\/footer>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<script async src=\"https:\/\/pagead2.googlesyndication.com\/pagead\/js\/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-5767364969818632\"\r\n     crossorigin=\"anonymous\"><\/script>\r\n<ins class=\"adsbygoogle\"\r\n     style=\"display:block; text-align:center;\"\r\n     data-ad-layout=\"in-article\"\r\n     data-ad-format=\"fluid\"\r\n     data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5767364969818632\"\r\n     data-ad-slot=\"6261327459\"><\/ins>\r\n<script>\r\n     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});\r\n<\/script>\r\n    <!-- =========== CHECKLIST 2: ADMINISTRATION OF SUBCUTANEOUS INJECTION =========== -->\r\n    <div class=\"checklist-container\" id=\"subcutaneous-injection\">\r\n        <header class=\"checklist-header\">\r\n            <h1>UGANDA NURSES AND MIDWIVES EXAMINATIONS BOARD<\/h1>\r\n            <h1>YEAR 2: SEMESTER 1: EXAMINATIONS<\/h1>\r\n            <h1>DIPLOMA IN NURSING (DIRECT)<\/h1>\r\n            <h1>Paper code: DND 215 OSPE<\/h1>\r\n            <h1>June 2024<\/h1>\r\n            <p class=\"checklist-title\">Examiners' Checklist<\/p>\r\n        <\/header>\r\n        <section class=\"info-section\">\r\n            <div class=\"info-field\"><label>STATION NO: 3<\/label><\/div><div class=\"info-field\"><\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"info-field\"><label>TASK: ADMINISTRATION OF SUBCUTANEOUS INJECTION<\/label><\/div><div class=\"info-field\"><\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"info-field\"><label>Examiner's Name:<\/label><div class=\"line\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"info-field\"><label>Date:<\/label><div class=\"line\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"info-field\"><label>School code:<\/label><div class=\"line\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"info-field\"><label>Candidate's No:<\/label><div class=\"line\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n        <div class=\"table-scroll-wrapper\">\r\n            <table class=\"checklist-table\">\r\n                <thead><tr><th class=\"col-num\"><\/th><th class=\"col-key-areas\">Key areas to assess<\/th><th class=\"col-score\">Score<\/th><th class=\"col-status\">Done<\/th><th class=\"col-status\">Partially done<\/th><th class=\"col-status\">Not done<\/th><\/tr><\/thead>\r\n                <tbody>\r\n                    <tr><td class=\"col-num\">1<\/td><td class=\"col-key-areas\">Reads the patient's chart to check the drug and dose with the qualified nurse<\/td><td class=\"col-score\">\u00bd<\/td><td><\/td><td>x<\/td><td><\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td class=\"col-num\">2<\/td><td class=\"col-key-areas\">Explains the procedure to the patient and provides privacy<\/td><td class=\"col-score\">\u00bd<\/td><td><\/td><td>x<\/td><td><\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td class=\"col-num\">3<\/td><td class=\"col-key-areas\">Assists the patient into a comfortable position for the injection<\/td><td class=\"col-score\">\u00bd<\/td><td><\/td><td>x<\/td><td><\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td class=\"col-num\">4<\/td><td class=\"col-key-areas\">Chooses a suitable needle gauge 1 ml or 2 ml syringe<\/td><td class=\"col-score\">1<\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td class=\"col-num\">5<\/td><td class=\"col-key-areas\">Washes hands and draws the dose correctly, expelling air<\/td><td class=\"col-score\">1<\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td class=\"col-num\">6<\/td><td class=\"col-key-areas\">Selects the right site and cleans it methodically<\/td><td class=\"col-score\">1<\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td class=\"col-num\">7<\/td><td class=\"col-key-areas\">Grasps or pinches the patient's skin gently between finger and thumb of the non-dominant hand<\/td><td class=\"col-score\">1<\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td class=\"col-num\">8<\/td>\r\n                        <td class=\"col-key-areas\">Administers the injection:<ul class=\"sub-items\"><li>\u2022 Holds the syringe at a 45\u00b0 to the skin and inserts the needle into the site quickly and firmly<\/li><li>\u2022 Withdraws the piston a little to make sure it is not in the blood vessel and then injects slowly while reassuring the patient<\/li><li>\u2022 Places a swab over the needle, removes the needle quickly and applies little pressure but not massaging<\/li><li>\u2022 Thanks the patient and clears away<\/li><\/ul><\/td>\r\n                        <td class=\"col-score\"><ul class=\"sub-items\" style=\"text-align: center; padding:0;\"><li>1<\/li><li>1<\/li><li>1<\/li><li>\u00bd<\/li><\/ul><\/td>\r\n                        <td><\/td><td><ul class=\"sub-items\" style=\"text-align: center; padding:0;\"><li><\/li><li><\/li><li><\/li><li>x<\/li><\/ul><\/td><td><\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td class=\"col-num\">9<\/td><td class=\"col-key-areas\">Washes hands and record in the patients treatment sheet correctly<\/td><td class=\"col-score\">1<\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><\/tr>\r\n                <\/tbody>\r\n                <tfoot><tr><td colspan=\"2\">TOTAL<\/td><td class=\"col-score\">10<\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><\/tr><\/tfoot>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <section class=\"comments-section\"><label>Examiner's Comments<\/label><div class=\"line\"><\/div><\/section>\r\n        <footer class=\"footer-logo\">@unmeb<\/footer>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <script async src=\"https:\/\/pagead2.googlesyndication.com\/pagead\/js\/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-5767364969818632\"\r\n     crossorigin=\"anonymous\"><\/script>\r\n<!-- Display Ad Posts -->\r\n<ins class=\"adsbygoogle\"\r\n     style=\"display:block\"\r\n     data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5767364969818632\"\r\n     data-ad-slot=\"7570414357\"\r\n     data-ad-format=\"auto\"\r\n     data-full-width-responsive=\"true\"><\/ins>\r\n<script>\r\n     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});\r\n<\/script>\r\n    <!-- =========== CHECKLIST 3: ASSESSMENT OF COGNITIVE SPHERE =========== -->\r\n    <div class=\"checklist-container\" id=\"cognitive-sphere\">\r\n        <header class=\"checklist-header\">\r\n            <h1>UGANDA NURSES AND MIDWIVES EXAMINATIONS BOARD<\/h1>\r\n            <h1>YEAR 2: SEMESTER 1: EXAMINATIONS<\/h1>\r\n            <h1>DIPLOMA IN NURSING (DIRECT)<\/h1>\r\n            <h1>Paper code: DND 215 OSPE<\/h1>\r\n            <h1>June 2024<\/h1>\r\n            <p class=\"checklist-title\">Examiners' Checklist<\/p>\r\n        <\/header>\r\n        <section class=\"info-section\">\r\n            <div class=\"info-field\"><label>STATION NO: 2<\/label><\/div><div class=\"info-field\"><\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"info-field\"><label>TASK: ASSESSMENT OF COGNITIVE SPHERE<\/label><\/div><div class=\"info-field\"><\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"info-field\"><label>Examiner's Name:<\/label><div class=\"line\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"info-field\"><label>Date:<\/label><div class=\"line\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"info-field\"><label>School code:<\/label><div class=\"line\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"info-field\"><label>Candidate's No:<\/label><div class=\"line\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n        <div class=\"table-scroll-wrapper\">\r\n            <table class=\"checklist-table\">\r\n                <thead><tr><th class=\"col-num\"><\/th><th class=\"col-key-areas\">Key areas to assess<\/th><th class=\"col-score\">Score<\/th><th class=\"col-status\">Done<\/th><th class=\"col-status\">Partially done<\/th><th class=\"col-status\">Not done<\/th><\/tr><\/thead>\r\n                <tbody>\r\n                    <tr><td class=\"col-num\">1<\/td><td class=\"col-key-areas\">Create rapport.<\/td><td class=\"col-score\">-<\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td class=\"col-num\">2<\/td>\r\n                        <td class=\"col-key-areas\">Assesses the cognitive sphere:<ul class=\"sub-items\"><li>\u2022 Orientation on;<ul class=\"sub-items\" style=\"padding-left:10px;\"><li>- Place<\/li><li>- Person<\/li><li>- Time<\/li><\/ul><\/li><li>\u2022 Attention and concentration.<\/li><li>\u2022 Level of judgment.<\/li><li>\u2022 Level of consciousness.<\/li><li>\u2022 Memory;<ul class=\"sub-items\" style=\"padding-left:10px;\"><li>- Recent, intermediate and long term.<\/li><li>- Intermediate<\/li><li>- Longterm<\/li><\/ul><\/li><li>\u2022 Intelligence.<\/li><li>\u2022 Abstract thinking.<\/li><li>\u2022 Insight.<\/li><\/ul><\/td>\r\n                        <td class=\"col-score\"><ul class=\"sub-items\" style=\"text-align: center; padding:0;\"><li><br>\u00bd<br>\u00bd<br>\u00bd<\/li><li>2<\/li><li>1<\/li><li>1<\/li><li><br>\u00bd<br>\u00bd<br>\u00bd<\/li><li>1<\/li><li>1<\/li><li>1<\/li><\/ul><\/td>\r\n                        <td><\/td><td><ul class=\"sub-items\" style=\"text-align: center; padding:0;\"><li><br>x<br>x<br>x<\/li><li><\/li><li><\/li><li><\/li><li><br>x<br>x<br>x<\/li><\/ul><\/td><td><\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                <\/tbody>\r\n                <tfoot><tr><td colspan=\"2\">TOTAL<\/td><td class=\"col-score\">10<\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><\/tr><\/tfoot>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <section class=\"comments-section\"><label>Examiner's Comments<\/label><div class=\"line\"><\/div><\/section>\r\n        <footer class=\"footer-logo\">@unmeb<\/footer>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <script async src=\"https:\/\/pagead2.googlesyndication.com\/pagead\/js\/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-5767364969818632\"\r\n     crossorigin=\"anonymous\"><\/script>\r\n<!-- Display Ad Posts -->\r\n<ins class=\"adsbygoogle\"\r\n     style=\"display:block\"\r\n     data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5767364969818632\"\r\n     data-ad-slot=\"7570414357\"\r\n     data-ad-format=\"auto\"\r\n     data-full-width-responsive=\"true\"><\/ins>\r\n<script>\r\n     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});\r\n<\/script>\r\n    <!-- =========== CHECKLIST 4: TREATMENT OF PRESSURE AREAS =========== -->\r\n    <div class=\"checklist-container\" id=\"pressure-areas\">\r\n        <header class=\"checklist-header\">\r\n            <h1>UGANDA NURSES AND MIDWIVES EXAMINATIONS BOARD<\/h1>\r\n            <h1>YEAR 2: SEMESTER 1: EXAMINATIONS<\/h1>\r\n            <h1>DIPLOMA IN NURSING (DIRECT)<\/h1>\r\n            <h1>Paper code: DND 215 OSPE<\/h1>\r\n            <h1>June 2024<\/h1>\r\n            <p class=\"checklist-title\">Examiners' Checklist<\/p>\r\n        <\/header>\r\n        <section class=\"info-section\">\r\n            <div class=\"info-field\"><label>STATION NO: 1<\/label><\/div><div class=\"info-field\"><\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"info-field\"><label>TASK: TREATMENT OF PRESSURE AREAS<\/label><\/div><div class=\"info-field\"><\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"info-field\"><label>Examiner's Name:<\/label><div class=\"line\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"info-field\"><label>Date:<\/label><div class=\"line\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"info-field\"><label>School code:<\/label><div class=\"line\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"info-field\"><label>Candidate's No:<\/label><div class=\"line\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n        <div class=\"table-scroll-wrapper\">\r\n            <table class=\"checklist-table\">\r\n                <thead><tr><th class=\"col-num\"><\/th><th class=\"col-key-areas\">Key areas to assess<\/th><th class=\"col-score\">Score<\/th><th class=\"col-status\">Done<\/th><th class=\"col-status\">Partially done<\/th><th class=\"col-status\">Not done<\/th><\/tr><\/thead>\r\n                <tbody>\r\n                    <tr><td class=\"col-num\">1<\/td><td class=\"col-key-areas\">Creates rapport<\/td><td class=\"col-score\">\u00bd<\/td><td><\/td><td>x<\/td><td><\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td class=\"col-num\">2<\/td><td class=\"col-key-areas\">Washes hands<\/td><td class=\"col-score\">\u00bd<\/td><td><\/td><td>x<\/td><td><\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td class=\"col-num\">3<\/td><td class=\"col-key-areas\">Positions the patient<\/td><td class=\"col-score\">\u00bd<\/td><td><\/td><td>x<\/td><td><\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td class=\"col-num\">4<\/td><td class=\"col-key-areas\">Pours water into the basin and mix it (cold and hot)<\/td><td class=\"col-score\">1<\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td class=\"col-num\">5<\/td><td class=\"col-key-areas\">Places the mackintosh and towel under the areas to be treated<\/td><td class=\"col-score\">1<\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td class=\"col-num\">6<\/td><td class=\"col-key-areas\">Put on protective wear<\/td><td class=\"col-score\">\u00bd<\/td><td><\/td><td>x<\/td><td><\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td class=\"col-num\">7<\/td>\r\n                        <td class=\"col-key-areas\">Treats pressure areas;<ul class=\"sub-items\"><li>\u2022 With a soapy hand massages each area in a circular motion for at least one minute to stimulate blood flow<\/li><li>\u2022 Rinses each part with a wet flannel and dry with a towel and dry it<\/li><li>\u2022 Applies Vaseline on the area and in incontinent patient, apply a barrier cream<\/li><\/ul><\/td>\r\n                        <td class=\"col-score\"><ul class=\"sub-items\" style=\"text-align: center; padding:0;\"><li>2<\/li><li>1<\/li><li>2<\/li><\/ul><\/td>\r\n                        <td><\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td>\r\n                    <\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td class=\"col-num\">8<\/td><td class=\"col-key-areas\">Changes or straightens the bed clothes<\/td><td class=\"col-score\">\u00bd<\/td><td><\/td><td>x<\/td><td><\/td><\/tr>\r\n                    <tr><td class=\"col-num\">9<\/td><td class=\"col-key-areas\">Makes the bed and leaves the patient comfortable<\/td><td class=\"col-score\">\u00bd<\/td><td><\/td><td>x<\/td><td><\/td><\/tr>\r\n                <\/tbody>\r\n                <tfoot><tr><td colspan=\"2\">TOTAL<\/td><td class=\"col-score\">10<\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><\/tr><\/tfoot>\r\n            <\/table>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <section class=\"comments-section\"><label>Examiner's Comments<\/label><div class=\"line\"><\/div><\/section>\r\n        <footer class=\"footer-logo\">@unmeb<\/footer>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n    <script async src=\"https:\/\/pagead2.googlesyndication.com\/pagead\/js\/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-5767364969818632\"\r\n     crossorigin=\"anonymous\"><\/script>\r\n<!-- Display Ad Posts -->\r\n<ins class=\"adsbygoogle\"\r\n     style=\"display:block\"\r\n     data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5767364969818632\"\r\n     data-ad-slot=\"7570414357\"\r\n     data-ad-format=\"auto\"\r\n     data-full-width-responsive=\"true\"><\/ins>\r\n<script>\r\n     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});\r\n<\/script>\r\n    <!-- =========== CHECKLIST 5: ASSISTING PATIENT TO PERFORM DEEP BREATHING EXERCISES =========== -->\r\n    <div class=\"checklist-container\" id=\"breathing-exercises\">\r\n        <header class=\"checklist-header\">\r\n            <h1>UGANDA NURSES AND MIDWIVES EXAMINATIONS BOARD<\/h1>\r\n            <h1>YEAR 2: SEMESTER 1: EXAMINATIONS<\/h1>\r\n            <h1>DIPLOMA IN NURSING (DIRECT)<\/h1>\r\n            <h1>Paper code: DND 215 OSPE<\/h1>\r\n            <h1>June 2024<\/h1>\r\n            <p class=\"checklist-title\">Examiners' Checklist<\/p>\r\n        <\/header>\r\n        <section class=\"info-section\">\r\n            <div class=\"info-field\"><label>STATION NO: 5<\/label><\/div><div class=\"info-field\"><\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"info-field\"><label>TASK: ASSISTING PATIENT TO PERFORM DEEP BREATHING EXERCISES<\/label><\/div><div class=\"info-field\"><\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"info-field\"><label>Examiner's Name:<\/label><div class=\"line\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"info-field\"><label>Date:<\/label><div class=\"line\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"info-field\"><label>School code:<\/label><div class=\"line\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n            <div class=\"info-field\"><label>Candidate's No:<\/label><div class=\"line\"><\/div><\/div>\r\n        <\/section>\r\n        <div cla